            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>The present invention relates to a metal oxide nanoparticle dispersion liquid comprising: metal oxide nanoparticles; and an organic base having an amidine skeleton or a guanidine skeleton, wherein a molar ratio of a content of the organic base to a content of a metal component constituting the metal oxide nanoparticles is 0.03 or less.</p>
